		"description": "Postman Collection untuk testing API Absensi, Cuti, Hari Libur, Pengaturan Sistem, dan Distributor pada aplikasi PBICS (Laravel Backend).\n\nCara Penggunaan:\n1. Import file ini ke Postman.\n2. Jalankan request 'Login Karyawan' dengan username & password yang sesuai.\n3. Token 'access_token' akan otomatis disimpan ke Collection Variable 'token' sehingga Anda tidak perlu copy-paste manual untuk request lainnya.\n4. Jalankan request absensi/cuti/lembur/hari libur/pengaturan/distributor.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. Auth",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Login Karyawan",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"if (jsonData.access_token) {",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", jsonData.access_token);",
									"    console.log(\"Token berhasil disimpan secara otomatis!\");",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"Username\": \"karyawan_username\",\n    \"Password\": \"karyawan_password\"\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/login",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"login"
							]
						}
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
